      "html": "<div class=\"ds-markdown ds-assistant-message-main-content\"><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">易拉宝是一种便携式的立式宣传海报展示架</span></strong><span class=\"\">。它的名字很形象，因为使用时可以将印好的画面从底座里“容易地拉出来”并固定好，因此得名。在广告行业，它也叫易拉架、易拉得或海报架</span><span class=\"\">。</span><span class=\"_5f9bba8\" data-citation-group=\"1\"><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%98%93%E6%8B%89%E5%AE%9D/10786842?fromtitle=%E6%98%93%E6%8B%89%E6%9E%B6&amp;fromid=4187930&amp;bst=1790073821.63e05153b9f3d68d#1#1#1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"1\"><span class=\"ds-markdown-cite\" style=\"display: inline; cursor: pointer; padding: 1.8px 4px 1.8px;\"><span style=\"opacity: 0; margin: 0px 0.525px;\">-</span><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%);\">1</span></span></a><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%BF%83%E9%94%80%E9%81%93%E5%85%B7/3398909?bst=1792185542.2465b019ba5a75dc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"4\"><span class=\"ds-markdown-cite\" style=\"display: inline; cursor: pointer; padding: 1.8px 4px 1.8px;\"><span style=\"opacity: 0; margin: 0px 0.525px;\">-</span><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%);\">4</span></span></a></span></p><h3><span class=\"\">🏗️ 它是怎么构成的？</span></h3><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">易拉宝的核心是一个</span><strong><span class=\"\">座地卷轴</span></strong><span class=\"\">，里面装有弹簧，可以把海报卷起来收纳。卷轴上方连接着一根</span><strong><span class=\"\">可伸缩的支撑杆</span></strong><span class=\"\">，顶部有个扣子用来固定海报的顶端。使用时拉出画面，用支撑杆撑直；不用时收回，画面就自动卷回底座里，整体会缩成一个长筒状。</span><span class=\"_5f9bba8\" data-citation-group=\"3\"><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%98%93%E6%8B%89%E5%AE%9D/10786842?fromtitle=%E6%98%93%E6%8B%89%E6%9E%B6&amp;fromid=4187930&amp;bst=1790073821.63e05153b9f3d68d#1#1#1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"1\"><span class=\"ds-markdown-cite\" style=\"display: inline; cursor: pointer; padding: 1.8px 4px 1.8px;\"><span style=\"opacity: 0; margin: 0px 0.525px;\">-</span><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%);\">1</span></span></a><a href=\"https://www.maka.im/baike/10269.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"9\"><span class=\"ds-markdown-cite\" style=\"display: inline; cursor: pointer; padding: 1.8px 4px 1.8px;\"><span style=\"opacity: 0; margin: 0px 0.525px;\">-</span><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%);\">9</span></span></a></span></p><h3><span class=\"\">✨ 主要特点与用途</span></h3><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">核心优势</span></strong><span class=\"\">：</span><strong><span class=\"\">轻巧便携</span></strong><span class=\"\">（重量一般在</span><strong><span class=\"\">2～5公斤</span></strong><span class=\"\">）、</span><strong><span class=\"\">安装极简</span></strong><span class=\"\">（拉开即用）、</span><strong><span class=\"\">经济实用</span></strong><span class=\"\">（可反复更换画面）。</span><span class=\"_5f9bba8\" data-citation-group=\"6\"><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%BF%83%E9%94%80%E9%81%93%E5%85%B7/3398909?bst=1792185542.2465b019ba5a75dc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"4\"><span class=\"ds-markdown-cite\" style=\"display: inline; cursor: pointer; padding: 1.8px 4px 1.8px;\"><span style=\"opacity: 0; margin: 0px 0.525px;\">-</span><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%);\">4</span></span></a></span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">常见用途</span></strong><span class=\"\">：适用于</span><strong><span class=\"\">会议、展览、门店促销、新品发布、招聘、路演</span></strong><span class=\"\">等场合。你经常能在商场、展会或临时摊位旁看到它。</span><span class=\"_5f9bba8\" data-citation-group=\"7\"><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%98%93%E6%8B%89%E5%AE%9D/10786842?fromtitle=%E6%98%93%E6%8B%89%E6%9E%B6&amp;fromid=4187930&amp;bst=1790073821.63e05153b9f3d68d#1#1#1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"1\"><span class=\"ds-markdown-cite\" style=\"display: inline; cursor: pointer; padding: 1.8px 4px 1.8px;\"><span style=\"opacity: 0; margin: 0px 0.525px;\">-</span><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%);\">1</span></span></a></span></p></li></ul><h3><span class=\"\">📐 常见类型与规格</span></h3><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">材质</span></strong><span class=\"\">：支架主要为</span><strong><span class=\"\">铝合金</span></strong><span class=\"\">或</span><strong><span class=\"\">塑钢</span></strong><span class=\"\">。铝合金更耐用，可多次换画；塑钢则性价比高，使用也很普遍。画面材质常用PP合成纸、相纸或PVC胶片等。</span><span class=\"_5f9bba8\" data-citation-group=\"9\"><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%98%93%E6%8B%89%E5%AE%9D/10786842?fromtitle=%E6%98%93%E6%8B%89%E6%9E%B6&amp;fromid=4187930&amp;bst=1790073821.63e05153b9f3d68d#1#1#1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"1\"><span class=\"ds-markdown-cite\" style=\"display: inline; cursor: pointer; padding: 1.8px 4px 1.8px;\"><span style=\"opacity: 0; margin: 0px 0.525px;\">-</span><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%);\">1</span></span></a><a href=\"https://beta.chuangkit.com/blog/pingmiansheji98.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"7\"><span class=\"ds-markdown-cite\" style=\"display: inline; cursor: pointer; padding: 1.8px 4px 1.8px;\"><span style=\"opacity: 0; margin: 0px 0.525px;\">-</span><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%);\">7</span></span></a></span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">经典尺寸</span></strong><span class=\"\">：最通用的标准尺寸是 </span><strong><span class=\"\">80cm × 200cm</span></strong><span class=\"\">（画面通常为78cm×200cm）。其他常见宽度还有</span><strong><span class=\"\">60cm、85cm、100cm、120cm</span></strong><span class=\"\">等。</span><span class=\"_5f9bba8\" data-citation-group=\"11\"><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%98%93%E6%8B%89%E5%AE%9D/10786842?fromtitle=%E6%98%93%E6%8B%89%E6%9E%B6&amp;fromid=4187930&amp;bst=1790073821.63e05153b9f3d68d#1#1#1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"1\"><span class=\"ds-markdown-cite\" style=\"display: inline; cursor: pointer; padding: 1.8px 4px 1.8px;\"><span style=\"opacity: 0; margin: 0px 0.525px;\">-</span><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%);\">1</span></span></a><a href=\"https://beta.chuangkit.com/blog/pingmiansheji98.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"7\"><span class=\"ds-markdown-cite\" style=\"display: inline; cursor: pointer; padding: 1.8px 4px 1.8px;\"><span style=\"opacity: 0; margin: 0px 0.525px;\">-</span><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%);\">7</span></span></a></span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">特殊类型</span></strong><span class=\"\">：除了常规款，还有</span><strong><span class=\"\">桌面易拉宝</span></strong><span class=\"\">（小型化）、</span><strong><span class=\"\">双面易拉宝</span></strong><span class=\"\">、</span><strong><span class=\"\">电动易拉宝</span></strong><span class=\"\">等变体，以适应不同展示需求。</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">总的来说，易拉宝就是一种成本较低、布展撤展都很快捷的“立起来的海报”。</span></p></div>"
    }
  ],
